{"version":1,"content":"<p>中國共產黨第二十屆中央委員會第五次全體會議於今日（26日）至29日在北京召開，會議主要議程是中共中央政治局向中央委員會報告工作，研究持之以恒推進全面從嚴治黨若干重大問題。</p><p>（澎湃新聞）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:20:26.470046+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T01:27:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T23:38:31.484227+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:13:25.536546+00:00","content_hash":"c3d55d982a7b5fc2e48b62fbbc081190927d3bf80f5ac9adea768390ac77f0c9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}